    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a multi-barreled tank and face off against digital viruses! Navigate through the motherboard, battle powerful bosses, and unlock new zones. Keep an eye on the Upgrade Machine \u2013 it boosts your abilities every 1-10 seconds. Earn points from previous runs to enhance your upgrade potential and outsmart the bugs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/0165a8995f057dda72ea1bc230c67ff6.poster.avif?t=1734593725\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/0165a8995f057dda72ea1bc230c67ff6.webm?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/0165a8995f057dda72ea1bc230c67ff6.mp4?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 21-Track Soundtrack by DOS - 88</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 25 Base Enemies + 5 Spawn Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 Main Bosses to conquer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique Weapons &amp; Upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collectables: Player icons &amp; mousepads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/07466ef461f5e9c82bccace9b6f7cc53.poster.avif?t=1734593725\" width=502 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/07466ef461f5e9c82bccace9b6f7cc53.webm?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/07466ef461f5e9c82bccace9b6f7cc53.mp4?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic Maps &amp; Lighting </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Custom Probability Algorithm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/e9d8808d632cfb1a4086126d2915ed99.poster.avif?t=1734593725\" width=340 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/e9d8808d632cfb1a4086126d2915ed99.webm?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/e9d8808d632cfb1a4086126d2915ed99.mp4?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for chaos, strategy, and non-stop action!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a multi-barreled tank and face off against digital viruses! Navigate through the motherboard, battle powerful bosses, and unlock new zones. Keep an eye on the Upgrade Machine \u2013 it boosts your abilities every 1-10 seconds. Earn points from previous runs to enhance your upgrade potential and outsmart the bugs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/0165a8995f057dda72ea1bc230c67ff6.poster.avif?t=1734593725\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/0165a8995f057dda72ea1bc230c67ff6.webm?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/0165a8995f057dda72ea1bc230c67ff6.mp4?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 21-Track Soundtrack by DOS - 88</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 25 Base Enemies + 5 Spawn Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 Main Bosses to conquer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique Weapons &amp; Upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collectables: Player icons &amp; mousepads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/07466ef461f5e9c82bccace9b6f7cc53.poster.avif?t=1734593725\" width=502 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/07466ef461f5e9c82bccace9b6f7cc53.webm?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/07466ef461f5e9c82bccace9b6f7cc53.mp4?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic Maps &amp; Lighting </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Custom Probability Algorithm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/e9d8808d632cfb1a4086126d2915ed99.poster.avif?t=1734593725\" width=340 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/e9d8808d632cfb1a4086126d2915ed99.webm?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697390/extras/e9d8808d632cfb1a4086126d2915ed99.mp4?t=1734593725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for chaos, strategy, and non-stop action!</p>",
